  "content": "<h1>快樂幽靈傳承版</h1><p>此模組將25w15a版本的快樂幽靈反向移植。</p><p>主要特色：</p><ul>\n<li>快樂幽靈：最多可容納4名玩家騎乘</li>\n<li>16種顏色的鞍具</li>\n<li>可在下界化石中找到的乾燥幽靈</li>\n<li>新增音樂唱片<code>淚珠</code></li>\n</ul><p>完整功能請參閱<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.wiki%252fw%252fHappy_Ghast\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft維基</a></p><p>想用繩索牽引快樂幽靈？試試這個模組：更多牽繩 (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moreleads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a> | <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmoreleads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a>)</p><p>想讓快樂幽靈的材質像標誌右側那樣？將你的快樂幽靈命名為<code>Kiki</code>！</p><p>本模組經過完整測試後將移植到其他版本</p><div><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IAFEnvoy/HappyGhastLegacy/refs/heads/master/img/1.webp\" style=\"width:400px;text-align:center\" alt=\"\"></div><div><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IAFEnvoy/HappyGhastLegacy/refs/heads/master/img/2.webp\" style=\"width:400px;text-align:center\" alt=\"\"></div>",
